<title>USA: USDA - CCC crop loan interest rates dip in July.</title>
<headline>USDA - CCC crop loan interest rates dip in July.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Tuesday that interest rates for Commodity Credit Corp. loans made during July will be 5.75 percent for 1996 and 1997 crops, down 0.125 percent from June.</p>
<p>((Washington commodities desk 202 898 8341))</p>
</text>
